  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0001",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "# LocalGPT: Privacy-First Local AI Assistant\n\nLocalGPT is an open-source, fully local AI assistant that runs Large Language Models (LLMs) entirely on your local hardware without sending your prompts or documents to external servers.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 232,
      "word_count": 34
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0002",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "## Key Capabilities",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 19,
      "word_count": 3
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0003",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "1. **Local Conversational AI**: Run open-weights models like Qwen 2.5, TinyLlama, GPT-2, and OPT with customizable system prompts, temperature, and top-p sampling.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 163,
      "word_count": 22
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0004",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "2. **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)**: Ingest documents (PDF, Markdown, DOCX, TXT, CSV, Code) into a local vector database to answer queries with direct source citations.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 176,
      "word_count": 24
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0005",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "3",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 1,
      "word_count": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0006",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "**Mechanistic Interpretability (X-Ray)**: Inspect attention matrices across all layers and heads, explore Logit Lens early token predictions, observe Residual Stream L2 norm growth",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 6,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 180,
      "word_count": 23
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0007",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "observe Residual Stream L2 norm growth, and track representation drift.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
      "chunk_index": 7,
      "total_chunks": 10,
      "char_length": 71,
      "word_count": 10
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7_chk_0008",
    "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
    "text": "4. **Persistent Memory & Sessions**: Save multi-turn conversation sessions to local SQLite databases with sliding window context management.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "metadata": {
      "filename": "about_localgpt.md",
      "file_type": "md",
      "doc_id": "6ae5d5b3812691d7",
